/**
 * Seed script — single entry point for all PolarX fixtures.
 *
 * Phases 0–2:  the three real research stations, demo missions, demo shipments.
 * Phase 3:     256 inventory items generated by a deterministic loop to hit the
 *              target demo distribution (adequate 142 / low-stock 63 /
 *              critical 26 / out-of-stock 25 — the Phase 7 slide targets).
 * Phase 4–7:   personnel, emergency alerts, users + station capacity updates
 *              are appended by later phases.
 *
 * The generator is deterministic (seeded PRNG), so two runs on the same
 * database produce the same dataset. All inserts are idempotent by natural key.
 *
 * Run with: npm run seed
 */
